# Documentation. Nothing that is built or tested reads these files, so a change
# to them is not a change to the app. Nx leaves them out of every project, CI asks
# Nx what a push touches, and a push that touches only these runs nothing.
#
# PRIVACY_POLICY.md and TERMS_OF_SERVICE.md are not here, on purpose: the app
# imports both and renders them at /privacy and /terms.
docs/
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
SECURITY.md
PWA_TESTING.md
LICENSE
